#!/usr/bin/python3
"""Migrates an original eFa 5.0 (MailScanner, MailWatch, Apache) to the rspamd/nginx eFa, in place.

Without --execute-i-have-a-snapshot it only prints what would be carried over and changes nothing.
There is no rollback besides the VM snapshot; the backup directory holds the old configuration and databases.
Apache, PHP and Perl stay installed on the host, Apache is only stopped so nginx gets ports 80 and 443.
"""
